        "text": "Land combat (spec/systems/combat.md func_05CA7E land decider + func_05B2C2 consequence applier). odds = ATK/(ATK+DEF); act-mode roll = random_int(1, ATK+DEF) <= ATK => attacker wins. DEF folds in the terrain/fort defense bonus ($TERRAIN Defensive: forests 2 / Hills 4 / Mountains 6, BYTE_VERIFIED). Loser walks down the demotion ladder (Soldiers->Colonist, Dragoons->Soldiers, ...) or is destroyed if it has no demotion. Demo resolves unit0 (attacker) attacking unit1 (defender); CombatOdds shows the win %."
